          </div>
          <div>
            <p class="font-label text-primary font-bold text-sm mb-2">EURO PALLET</p>
            <p class="font-body text-on-surface text-sm">3-ply C-flute | 1200x1000mm</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <p class="font-label text-primary font-bold text-sm mb-2">HEAVY LAYER (cans/tiles)</p>
            <p class="font-body text-on-surface text-sm">5-ply BC-flute | custom cut</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <p class="font-label text-primary font-bold text-sm mb-2">INDUSTRIAL HEAVY</p>
            <p class="font-body text-on-surface text-sm">Honeycomb 30mm | custom cut</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <section class="mb-12">
        <h2 class="font-headline text-2xl font-bold text-on-surface mb-6">Layer Pad FAQs</h2>
        <div class="space-y-4">
          <details class="group border border-outline-variant/20 rounded-lg p-4">
            <summary class="font-label font-bold text-on-surface cursor-pointer">What size pallet interleaving sheets do most Malaysian warehouses need?</summary>
            <p class="font-body text-on-surface text-sm mt-3 leading-relaxed">1100x1100mm square (most common) or 1200x1000mm Euro-style for export. Custom sizes available from one full sheet upward.</p>
          </details>
          <details class="group border border-outline-variant/20 rounded-lg p-4">
            <summary class="font-label font-bold text-on-surface cursor-pointer">What thickness should layer pads be?</summary>
            <p class="font-body text-on-surface text-sm mt-3 leading-relaxed">3-ply C-flute under 200kg per layer; 5-ply BC for 200-500kg; honeycomb panels above 500kg.</p>
          </details>
          <details class="group border border-outline-variant/20 rounded-lg p-4">
            <summary class="font-label font-bold text-on-surface cursor-pointer">Do I need layer pads if products are already in cartons?</summary>
            <p class="font-body text-on-surface text-sm mt-3 leading-relaxed">Yes, especially above 1.6m stack height. Layer pads spread the load and prevent corner-crush damage.</p>
          </details>
          <details class="group border border-outline-variant/20 rounded-lg p-4">
            <summary class="font-label font-bold text-on-surface cursor-pointer">Can the sheets be printed with our company name?</summary>
            <p class="font-body text-on-surface text-sm mt-3 leading-relaxed">Yes — single colour flexo print from 5,000 sheets. Lead time 7-10 working days.</p>
          </details>
          <details class="group border border-outline-variant/20 rounded-lg p-4">
            <summary class="font-label font-bold text-on-surface cursor-pointer">How fast can you supply 5,000 sheets?</summary>
            <p class="font-body text-on-surface text-sm mt-3 leading-relaxed">Standard sizes 3-5 working days; custom or printed 7-10 working days. Rush production by request.</p>
          </details>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="mb-12 bg-primary/5 border border-primary/20 rounded-lg p-8">
        <h2 class="font-headline text-2xl font-bold text-on-surface mb-4">Wholesale Layer Pads Cut to Your Pallet</h2>
        <p class="font-body text-on-surface leading-relaxed mb-6">Whether you need 500 sheets for a single batch or 50,000 sheets a month for an FMCG line, Quinocycle cuts to spec at our Balakong factory. Klang Valley delivery available daily.</p>
        <p class="font-body text-on-surface mb-6"><strong>Contact Quinocycle today:</strong></p>
        <ul class="font-body text-on-surface text-sm space-y-2 mb-6">
          <li>📞 <strong>Phone:</strong> +60 16 8916 381 / 03-8962 6381</li>
          <li>📧 <strong>Email:</strong> quinocycle@gmail.com</li>
          <li>📍 <strong>Address:</strong> No.13, Jalan Taming P/1, Taming Jaya, Balakong, Selangor 43300</li>
        </ul>
        <a href={WA_LINK} class="inline-block bg-primary text-on-primary font-label font-bold text-sm px-6 py-3 rounded-lg hover:opacity-90 transition-opacity">💬 Chat on WhatsApp</a>
      </section>

      <section class="mb-8">
        <h2 class="font-headline text-2xl font-bold text-on-surface mb-4">Conclusion: Cheap Sheets, Expensive Damage Prevented</h2>
        <p class="font-body text-on-surface leading-relaxed mb-4">A layer pad costs less than a packet of nasi lemak. The damage it prevents — crushed cartons, scuffed printed shippers, leaning pallets — costs orders of magnitude more. If your warehouse damage rate is creeping up, layer pads are the first place to look.</p>
        <p class="font-body text-on-surface leading-relaxed">Quinocycle ships standard and custom layer pads across Selangor and Peninsular Malaysia. WhatsApp for a quick spec quote.</p>
      </section>
    </div>
